  "decision": "Retain HSA_SCRATCH_SINGLE_LIMIT=8388608 as the gfx1100 process-start default. It removes 132 MiB from ROCr's reserved single-dispatch threshold without changing tracked hipEngine ownership, kernel math, decode/MTP, or explicit user policy. Clean XTX and W7900 gates are exact and move every throughput median by at most 0.235% versus upstream-default controls. The performance-bearing 300-MiB monolithic AOTriton use-once path remains; per-KV and per-Q-head splits are rejected. Vulkan memory parity remains open at 0.212/0.354/0.737/0.737 GiB for 512/1K/4K/8K."
